# #5837: orphan repair re-runs the proof, which then latches.
MODULE: RepairLatchesRepairSkipsReproof
TARGET: RepairLatches
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: orphan repair begins without re-running L's reachability proof, so an exempt L stays unlatched while its range is re-homed (a5e2e2ef's condition 3)
PERTURBS: StartRepair
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithSplitBirth = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1, WithMixedVersion = FALSE, WithDuplicate = FALSE, WithLatch = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ repair' = TRUE
    /\ tried' = FALSE
--- REPLACE
    /\ repair' = TRUE
\* MUTATION: the proof is not re-run.
    /\ tried' = TRUE
--- END
